#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 446e6873ab055f6aa54e660ff1588a89ee0a84f3387217213e1425662e62d9a0
#. default-sha256: 6aa368f64f57371ff54d560db19e188f01a099318a7a8b1f2440528d6d5010cc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il suo era un potere che rievocava l’immagine di streghe e demoni—⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫di esseri corrotti e impuri."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4933ced8bc625f6eee124fef663740f18a04559193835369e19d41f9b48c96d9
#. default-sha256: 8b3ff8d8b41cef5ad5a195aa545349dac5ae0627759ac26ff60daec4c20b5a70
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Gli bastava un semplice tocco per privare un uomo o una bestia della propria vita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2c6df5517c733f2a1802b99d204727fc7c803538446ccea4f991ad2602a854e
#. default-sha256: 17e44b361c39af0c260b8a1bda8d04bf8dbf352d77256db4d9a390449dd93f06
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dio era stato alquanto crudele a conferire un potere del genere ad un uomo così bello."

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a9027ae41c1d85239033e5c3be8a0d792096cfaf3c9982a6d6b2058b36541ea
#. default-sha256: dec75c1731b203321a58855ae71805c08fb70f4c1c3c7f8c225d0c40e2bb4683
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ed era un potere davvero insolito—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sembrava uscito da una favola."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 537ec39fe6f1d0b429dad809ad0320d0fcd7e8592cbb7d835cf20e6c9ac27d89
#. default-sha256: 23191ac84932978176f6265dedc08ea5a9acdc9eca36f3259175fd946f1b4e3e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sembrava irreale—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫incredibile—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫come qualcosa di confinato nelle pagine di "
"un libro."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9729b22168b67dda9aa820159c66732e91b761bce0f36ded2068dc47c591d576
#. default-sha256: 5e8fcd39965592089c6b352ef72c61a2629f46827e0f6f0526ea8061a531d3aa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure, come aveva dimostrato alla Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi,⟪k:1⟫i suoi caratteristici "
"poteri erano reali."

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adf1915a8be54e4e758c383e812d1a301ed01a9b601bfe4f4cb9c82c1a158b2e
#. default-sha256: 430eab4f129b03bb8725920bafd96ba6ce49ef99b8cd691ebd49ddce7a74fefb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nel mondo c’è una buona dose di stranezze—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2647e539c080329aca2203f9218e91346815702a09f3908afcbf35f828e217e
#. default-sha256: 5da38538de5c2640a8b64ac5911dc3af159b7b750f1ba42bcc83c630d1c1328b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫è solo che queste curiosità tendono a rimanere nascoste,⟪k:1⟫conosciute solo a pochi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0442e4350be79e6c59e01edee00f6808da1bfae7be32d1abeb3145deb69320a7
#. default-sha256: 0db479dee8a0a49ac7e93d36f38fc7ecdb6141284d60260986fe230762463159
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Nonostante tutto, lei ha assistito in prima persona ad un gran numero di "
"fenomeni bizzarri, Padrone."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbdc9c5acd8431a654c8dd2c8098534e98b25390f3c36ee35d67e7de14ca82f3
#. default-sha256: 6af7af7613252886b6f8283951fea0120f7dcbe4b4622c080660c3d0fb7b190d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le porte del passato che abbiamo attraversato.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Questa stessa villa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5183268db7f3af98c848ca6394973233e7ab84800007364e77b28f02a286d6cc
#. default-sha256: b84247f434258125e40e968f900572e4d773922e312af0abc13ee1b2a8f8ae40
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E di fatto, noi due."

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64c19cace4186dfb48f286a4931277cc9e9575a16dfcbe8282a3b550a5b96fee
#. default-sha256: a2c58e908f1962f6ad5a6adb3fac5f68f50e58721ea18d364a96dccb873c4688
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dunque. Come ha appena visto, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi⟪k:1⟫era rimasta affascinata da "
"quell’uomo e dal suo potere maledetto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32a94ed5e15db737cdda9fda31cc9a726b734f1eac77fad8dac1da57e8a54721
#. default-sha256: fc2523b23818f71a00ecabeac71ca116cbabd97cab9e73cc2e72770f1d6f995c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come pensa che abbia reagito Michel alla sua dichiarazione?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a27d0ed2a8cdd4d433934b6652e94f44484a18b0873d89b662cd7a192281c720
#. default-sha256: 9ad0c80a8107885b06480afe9209ebb410572aa4f97d328fdf45a94cd382d910
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva rifiutato per così tanto di interagire con gli altri—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, era ⟪k:4⟫"
"incapace⟪k:5⟫ di interagire con loro.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E per questo, non sapeva come rispondere."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4517512e49bba0afffb5d54a9703e18d1660a82a92364aa7154daaf069d4704b
#. default-sha256: fc212127db9c810845f0274b2207b154d603f5dcfb59641cca5b72db50927ec4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dopo essere rimasto lì inespressivo per qualche attimo, mormorò:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcdf0c586b57497b072d843388ddab7445870ac5be7cbe8497453ce0597884a2
#. default-sha256: 8ce08cdb83fb2a8c453edc52ddc7ec3d615825d7f4729027aa7740b07573c0bc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ci penserò su."

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32612880c137448ec9ae0d95f4e2154f7f60ca342cb728577515f58f7805fd71
#. default-sha256: b7980350dad30ff8b890311890dc247f31ae2faf00cd406d3e1a693b75a51f3f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così, fece ritorno alla sua stanza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cf7810d07a194e8a0a55ad5418fb141841ebc9c53a80409122a816dd7f92f9a
#. default-sha256: d94a9b7fcc5effffc6c9af561303f987639cacc6bc5102bd97426b27c21859a8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene non fosse un uomo che parlava col cuore in mano,⟪k:1⟫personalmente non credo che "
"fosse del tutto privo di emozioni."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 417cab7573a5fa5eb97018fa58e998901d7f8148e6e0588ec003d0c259967b88
#. default-sha256: 199027b323e436f4334d7625bae7ebfef7f60a0abcd9dba13aa6b4234573633a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Stando in solitudine, aveva semplicemente dimenticato come esprimerle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9236db8dc39e8a263d183131d5e5efe77482bd4e729667cc3118cbc0a40dedc6
#. default-sha256: 4840bec7d6c70db723ff1716e62762a03ca2429a4d1ccb1f445275d4e6669ccd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quindi suppongo che in quel momento si trovasse in uno stato di panico."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60c9dea53f1f728c07191d880b4c2a45d289a0a9b19188ed746d287f4aa9f0be
#. default-sha256: fa11a2c92cba4664f723465cd43789edd5c22fcd2c73100d509911e45be00377
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dopotutto, lei lo aveva aggredito con un flusso di dichiarazioni incomprensibili,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a6b95e825deca8a0118840d36bc85892cb0e3c095f63890b174ac2b747db5ab
#. default-sha256: 7068aa21d984058c7fd738b872cf12042d7901459cb29d9aa7c287e3c9d49179
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫affermando che, pur conoscendo la verità, desiderava rimanere nella villa..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae630cac19e5ea8955043039da46632f455adfa52e2446ab6913c83de1aee76a
#. default-sha256: 33def1054e7b40cc47047bc1b514943072c9ffecad954b6c1f5a33be12e0c060
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e che, pur conoscendo la verità, lo amava."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0f6917df294d342dfaf8b74a6a621c5c38b8ca2952ee99e87f0ca610be75e9b
#. default-sha256: ed9c7fe817164a51ca7a1e7cb6f62a988d666cfa4ca8d2ce8c0f05c8cda84fd0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’amore che aveva dichiarato a Michel non era una passeggera infatuazione adolescenziale;"
"⟪k:1⟫ c’erano una sincera dolcezza e un calore genuino nelle sue parole."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b64cf37bda730b5fe254f02fe17386a4c3c9dce968573c639276598049fe6f7a
#. default-sha256: a41a4000d64bfcb2900397b924a2f7ebcf03b105e3d58092e5d340b62db487f4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma Michel aveva passato tutta la vita ad essere temuto, evitato, allontanato.⟪k:1⟫ Per lui, "
"era quella la normalità."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40783cbd21514428de501292074e23b0d01067e48840e9ce295499073c4ee981
#. default-sha256: eaf725c1f0c762ac2cd987e840ffdc02439b62482700e545a6a2e6f3ca88018f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never given anyone reason to have any fondness for him,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non aveva mai dato a nessuno alcuna ragione per legarsi a lui,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a61c52e70230e8acb1524cb68257ba41f42695aa64383296b55d4b15f37f200
#. default-sha256: f090b2430d5806ca83375db32a90ecf7feeef5c5687c5f68bd04e827fa38b092
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so he found himself utterly unsure how to take the affection she was showing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫per cui non sapeva come prendere quella manifestazione d’affetto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8b416db3ebec89bb7881f2cf822f8222424ff9e527a74d04a0cb50100bd42bf
#. default-sha256: e8a67d267aa1eb5684a6da54d0e190ca16819c3ddfc3910a050772e1bcff2756
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course... ⟪k:1⟫he was not the only one rattled by the whole affair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ovviamente... ⟪k:1⟫non era il solo a essere scosso dall’intera faccenda."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F2BD1EAC_2F55_47F8_8461_C52B49B7724E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cc98a64c057286812035ad3e01781ce4bd27d913869a916df2553332ed76a9e
